# The input to constraints.txt. Keep this in step with pyproject.toml's
# [project.dependencies] -- these are the same three pins, and the lock is
# regenerated from here rather than edited:
#
#     pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras \
#       --output-file=constraints.txt requirements.in
#
# Development tools are deliberately absent. They live in pyproject.toml's
# [dev] extra, they never ship, and an operator installing this tool never
# pulls them.
